This repository contains two kinds of material under different licenses.

1. Source code — MIT License
   Applies to everything except the files listed in section 2, including src/,
   scripts/ and the project configuration.

2. Third-party 3D car models — their original licenses
   The optimised models in public/models/ are adaptations (re-scaled, compressed,
   and for the 911 Turbo S, with a door closed) of models published on Sketchfab.
   They are NOT covered by the MIT License. Each keeps its author's license:

   public/models/718-rsk.glb
     "1959 Porsche 718 RSK" by OUTPISTON
     https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/1959-porsche-718-rsk-dbf16392121249d19ff643ae0655a301
     CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

   public/models/porsche930.glb
     "Porsche 911 (930) Turbo 1975" by vecarz
     https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/porsche-911930-turbo-1975-wwwvecarzcom-1b576d8b56e445fe8595e1b3fc07bcfe
     CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

   public/models/carrera-gt.glb
     "2004 Porsche Carrera GT" by OUTPISTON
     https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/2004-porsche-carrera-gt-9d48aa751ab24becbf7110e93c8a7a1f
     CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

   public/models/cayenne.glb
     "2011 Porsche Cayenne" by Ddiaz Design
     https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/2011-porsche-cayenne-c781eeb2c0e14f6e94d21feef6b5e7b3
