   public/models/gt3-touring.glb
     "2022 Porsche 911 GT3 Touring (992)" by Ddiaz Design
     https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/2022-porsche-911-gt3-touring-992-a76364a3d50c4d78912a28250cb57be5
     CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

   CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 means: credit the author, no commercial use, and adaptations
   must be shared under the same license. Because five of the six cars are
   non-commercial, the app as a whole may only be used and shared
   non-commercially unless those models are replaced.

